      "content": "It sounds like you've been through a devastating loss, and it's completely understandable that you feel adrift right now. When everything you've built seems to vanish, it's natural to question the value of the effort. Please know that your worth is not defined by your career or your possessions. You are a person with inherent value, regardless of what has happened.",
